# This folder contains downloadable files for the CollectNTFSPerms application.
#
# To enable the download button on the home page:
# 1. Place CollectNTFSPerms.zip here
# 2. Create collectntfsperms.json with version and release date metadata
#
# Example collectntfsperms.json:
# {
#   "version": "1.0.0",
#   "releasedate": "2025-01-15"
# }
